{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/01/2693453/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月になりました。\n昨日からぽかぽかしてきて嬉しくて\nナチュラルハイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/01/2693453/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徹夜でナチュラルハイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/01/2693453/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おういえーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛テスト勉強中！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達とメールで教え合い\n励まし合いながら勉強中。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりみなさん花粉症つらいね。\n共感してくれて嬉しかった、\n一緒だね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/01/2693453/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は13日の金曜日の衣装を\n紹介するよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼MV衣装／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/01/2693453/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャツワンピ bulle de savon\n羽織ってるカーディガン、靴下\nCHILD WOMAN"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服！\nみんな春先取りしてて\n個性が出ててカラフルだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年はシャーベットカラーの\nピンク、黄色、水色が流行ってたけど\n今年はだいすきな黄緑がくるらしい！\n高まるるるる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るい色いっぱい着たいなー♪\n女の子は今年の春服は買ったかな？\nみんな何買ったの～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のこの服は撮影前に\n何買うかメンバーにメールで\n相談してたの。したらあすかに\n「んじゃ、まりかは全身苔ね！」\nって言われたんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(だから黄緑なんだよ！)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらがライブ衣装。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/01/2693453/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわんふわんぼわんぼわん\n頭から靴下まで紫。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂初の髪飾りじゃないか...？\nカチューシャの飾りみんな違うの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はボンボンとチュールがついてる。\n流れ星みたいでかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着るとキャピッとしたくなる衣装"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/01/2693453/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！\n君の名は希望の衣装も撮ったら\n載せるねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も隅っこで静かに生きる\n苔たちを眺めながらの帰り道。\nおれのいやし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}